181
00:14:32.910 --> 00:14:38.520
Mul õnnestus osta alpi laagrist tutt
uued saapad.

182
00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:40.590
Puhi olin ma mõned aastad.

183
00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:42.150
Oled varem

184
00:14:42.250 --> 00:14:44.790
saanud endale osta Tallinna alpi
klubist,

185
00:14:44.890 --> 00:14:49.330
